# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must never be committed.
# A test in tests/test_environment.py asserts that.

# --- Neo4j (Challenge 3 onward) ---
# Note for Neo4j Aura: the database name and username are derived from the
# instance id, not the literal "neo4j". Check the credentials file Aura gives
# you at instance creation — it is the only time the password is shown.
NEO4J_URI=
NEO4J_USERNAME=
NEO4J_PASSWORD=
NEO4J_DATABASE=

# --- LLM provider ---
# Added when a decision record in docs/decisions/ selects one. Left blank
# deliberately: the model and provider are design decisions, not defaults.
